                    <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700" data-i18n="p1_note">
                        Registering a foreign branch requires corporate documents authenticated by the Ministry of Foreign Affairs in the origin country and the Jordanian Embassy. We manage the local legalization process directly.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <hr class="border-slate-200">

