                    Hiring local talent via foreign entities carries severe misclassification risks. We draft robust, dual-language employment agreements fully compliant with Jordanian Labor Law, ensuring comprehensive Intellectual Property (IP) assignments and confidentiality.
                </p>
                <div class="bg-sand-50 border-l-2 border-sand-500 p-4 rounded-r-lg mb-6">
