                    <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700" data-i18n="p2_note">
                        Under Jordanian Law, non-compete clauses are strictly scrutinized. They are only valid and enforceable if explicitly restricted by time, geographical location, and precise scope of business.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <hr class="border-slate-200">

