                <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy-900 mb-3" data-i18n="p3_title">Regulatory & Data Privacy</h2>
                <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-6" data-i18n="p3_sub">Data auditing and PDPL compliance representation.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="md:col-span-8 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm">
                <p class="text-slate-700 text-sm sm:text-base mb-6" data-i18n="p3_desc">
                    We act as your local compliance arm for Jordan's Personal Data Protection Law (Law No. 24/2023). Our legal operations team audits cross-border data transfers, drafts privacy notices, and acts as the official regulatory liaison.
                </p>
                <div class="bg-sand-50 border-l-2 border-sand-500 p-4 rounded-r-lg mb-6">
                    <h4 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-navy-900 mb-1" data-i18n="note_title">Jurisdiction Note</h4>
                    <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700" data-i18n="p3_note">
                        Foreign entities processing data of individuals residing in Jordan are legally obligated under PDPL to appoint an authorized local representative to handle regulatory inquiries and breach notifications.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <hr class="border-slate-200">

